      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-311812",
      ":question/problem": "![](images/5a/5adef019be6f263249e61a2da6b0bf26fa034de4792dd33793c7f84b4fc8b862.png)\n\nThe dot plot above shows the hours of television watched per week by $15$ households. If an additional household that watched $1$ hour is added to create a new data set of $16$ households, which of the following measures will be smaller for the new data set than for the original data set?\n\n1. The median hours\n2. The mean hours"
